  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName>.<lb/>
               This Evening, Thursday, <date when="1811-10-03">October 3, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be perform'd (<hi rend="allcaps">Ninth Time</hi>) <hi rend="allcaps">A New Farce</hi>, in Two Acts, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_darkness_visible"><quote>"Darkness Visible."</quote></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_th_ru">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grove">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_finn">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_sh_mu">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Munden</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_decamp">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_watson">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_minton">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               After which (first time this Season,) the Musical Piece, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_of_age_tomorrow">Of Age To-morrow.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Baron Willinghurst,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Baron Piffleberg,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Hans Melkus,</role> by <actor><hi rend="allcaps">A Gentleman,</hi></actor>-being his First Appearance.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mr. Friz,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_finn">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_widdicombe">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Brumback,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sophia,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Maria,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_garrick">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Garrick</hi>.</actor><lb/>
                  (From the Theatre-Royal, Bath-being her first appearance on this Stage.)</castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added (<hi rend="allcaps">Fourth Time</hi>) <hi rend="allcaps">A Melo Drame</hi>, call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title type="main" ref="namedentities.xml#play_travellers_benighted">Travellers Benighted;</title><lb/>
                  <title type="sub">Or, The Forest of Rosenwald.</title></bibl><lb/>
               The Subject of this Piece is taken from the Story of Raymond and Agnes in the Novel of<lb/>
               the <hi rend="allcaps">Monk</hi>:-The incidents will represent that Story in Dialogue which has hitherto<lb/>
               only been perform'd in Action.<lb/>
               With New Scenery, Dresses, and Decorations.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Overture</hi> and <hi rend="allcaps">Musick</hi> selected from the most eminent Composers.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Don Felix,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cooper">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Baron Lindenberg,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Raymond,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_r_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Theodore,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#sa_th_ru">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Russell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Baptiste,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_martin">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Claude ,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_noble">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Jaques,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_finn">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Marco,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_grove">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/> 
                  <castItem><role>Robert,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Domesticks,</role> Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hemmings">Hemmings,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_we">West,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_bynham">Bynham,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_shade">Shade,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Agnes,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Beatrice,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Ursula,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_minton">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Bleeding Nun,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_kendall">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Annette,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_watson">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Marguerette,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/> 
               </castList>
               The Doors to be Open'd at <time when="17:30:00">Half past Five o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin<lb/>
               at <time when="18:30:00">Half past Six</time>, precisely, for the remainder of the Season.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Price. Second Price.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Six Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi>,---<measure type="currency">Three Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling and Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">Two Shillings</measure>. - <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Upper Gallery</hi>, <measure type="currency">One Shilling</measure>. - <measure type="currency">Sixpence</measure>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mas">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi></persName> at the Theatre.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
